h4h5tools
------------------------------------------
Tools for converting between HDF4 and HDF5 formats

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libh4toh5-devel-2.2.5-1bl3
  libh4toh5_0-2.2.5-1bl3
  libhdf4_11-4.4.0-1
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  libhdf5hl_320-2.2.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  hdf5-2.2.0-1
  libhdf4-devel-4.4.0-1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://support.hdfgroup.org/downloads/h4h5tools/h4h5tools_2_2_5.html

Canonical download:
  https://support.hdfgroup.org/ftp/HDF5/releases/h4toh5/h4toh5-2.2.5/src/h4h5tools-2.2.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack h4h5tools-2.2.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./h4h5tools-2.2.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/h4h5tools-2.2.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/h4h5tools-2.2.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libh4toh5_0-2.2.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libh4toh5-devel-2.2.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(h4h5tools)
  /usr/bin/h4toh5.exe
  /usr/bin/h5toh4.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/h4h5tools.README
  /usr/share/doc/h4h5tools/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/h4h5tools/README.txt

(libh4toh5_0)
  /usr/bin/cygh4toh5-0.dll

(libh4toh5-devel)
  /usr/include/H4TOH5api_adpt.h
  /usr/include/h4toh5.h
  /usr/include/h4toh5apicompatible.h
  /usr/include/h4toh5vector.h
  /usr/lib/libh4toh5.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/h4toh5.pc

